# Line endings: the repo is authored LF (CLAUDE.md §B). The machines that touch it have
# core.autocrlf=true in the SYSTEM gitconfig, so the working tree is normalized here, not
# per clone. Windows shell scripts keep CRLF; archives, images and wheels are never text.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.whl binary
